The nine problem files preserve the published mathematical definitions and theorem
statements from tkmt-lab/a3-gsw-classification, tkmt-lab/gsw-ray-periodicity and
tkmt-lab/heesch-certificates. Their Lean code is Apache-2.0. Source commits and
file hashes are recorded in manifest.json; license records are in
checks/license-sources.json. The problem copies add an Apache header, public module
imports, a references section and solved/proof-link attributes. The mathematical
body is otherwise unchanged; the transformation can be reversed byte-for-byte.

